peacemachine-dvd-ripper (1.0.50) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The transcript no longer runs the silence filter inside a virtual machine.
    onnxruntime's filter froze the host outright when it ran in a KVM guest -
    four hard lock-ups, each at the moment the transcript started, and none
    once it was removed (C0D3D, 2026-11-15). Transcription itself is unchanged;
    ASR_VAD=1 forces the filter, ASR_VAD=0 turns it off everywhere.

