peacemachine-dvd-ripper (1.0.47) unstable; urgency=medium

  * PyAV is no longer required. faster-whisper imports it for its own decoding
    path, which this app never uses - it extracts audio with ffmpeg and feeds
    samples in directly. Where no PyAV wheel exists (Fedora 45, Python 3.15),
    the import is stubbed and the engine installs without dependencies plus the
    packages it actually needs.

