peacemachine-dvd-ripper (1.0.42) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Transcripts are installable. `peacemachine-dvd-ripper --install-asr` builds
    the speech-to-text venv in ~/.local/share/peacemachine-dvd-ripper/asr, since
    it cannot live in /usr. TRANSCRIPT now defaults to off when that venv is
